        "created_at": "2015-03-04T14:50:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Does the Ambuscade can hurt himself with traps have an official link with it?&nbsp; Spiff is usually pretty good about that.</p><p>I do know the Ambuscade vs. his automated hunter came up in the last tournament and I was the one who reminded Christopher that the characters are immune to their own powers.&nbsp; That vetoed that part of Ambuscade's suicide strategy.</p>",
